# Block list for the pre-commit check (scripts/check-private.mjs). Normally the check reads the list of the sibling
# ct-pass-store checkout (or the file named by $CT_PRIVATE_TERMS); to use a list of its own, copy this file to
# .private-terms (gitignored, never commit it) and replace these INVENTED examples. One term per line, # starts a
# comment, case-insensitive; "## allow: <glob>, <glob>" after a term ignores hits in matching paths.
Exemplary Chapel Riverside
exampleparish.church.tools
